# ─── Parent Workspace Leak Prevention ──────────────────────
# Never accidentally commit parent-level planning/audit artifacts
codex-plan*.md
AUDIT_REPORT*.md
IMPLEMENTATION_EVIDENCE*.md
IST_ANALYSE_*.md
PROGRESS.md
all-issues*.txt
togaf-check.html

